+| ID | Lines | Equation and assessment |
+|---|---|---|
+| E1 | 8-9 | `fibMath(N) = N` for `0 <= N <= 1`. True base cases. |
+| E2 | 10-11 | `fibMath(N) = fibMath(N-1)+fibMath(N-2)` for `N > 1`. True Fibonacci recurrence and strictly descends to E1 over integers. |
